  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252flupin\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Essentials/BH_ES_HEADER.webp\" width=\"1920\" height=\"508\"></strong></span></a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\">如果你在尋找一個為模組遊戲增添不可或缺基礎模組的整合包，這無疑是您的理想選擇。它是任何整合包的完美基底，當然，它也完全可自訂。您可以加入自己喜愛的模組！</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\">當然，您僅使用這個整合包就能暢玩精彩遊戲，無需額外添加任何內容，遊戲樂趣會大幅提升，且不會破壞原有體驗。這就像《我的世界》2.0！別猶豫了，試試看吧，您會發現只加幾個模組就能讓遊戲變得如此有趣。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/essentials-mods-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">立即下載專屬的 Fabric 版本！</a></span></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Essentials/BH_ES_BANNER1.webp\" width=\"1920\" height=\"291\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">總結來說，這個整合包的設立有兩個目標：其一，作為我其他整合包的基礎，我所有的整合包都內建這些模組！其二，它也是您個人化設定的完美基底。如果您想自行製作整合包，建議先安裝此包中的模組，再從中挑選您喜愛的加入。</span><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><br></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">😎 搭配以下模組享受更沉浸的體驗：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ambientsounds\" rel=\"nofollow\">AmbientSounds</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ambient-environment\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ambient Environment</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/falling-leaves-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\">Falling Leaves</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/visuality\" rel=\"nofollow\">Visuality</a> 或 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/visual-workbench\" rel=\"nofollow\">Visual Workbench</a>。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">🦁 別說沒有新內容，超過一百種動物正等待著您加入 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/alexs-mobs\" rel=\"nofollow\">Alex's Mobs</a>，還有更多！沒錯，<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/alexs-caves\" rel=\"nofollow\">Alex's Caves</a> 也已收錄於最新版本中啦 :D</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">🕌 建築結構也是本整合包的核心支柱之一，因此我們加入了所有 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/yungnickyoung/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\">YUNG's</a> 系列、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/medieval-buildings\" rel=\"nofollow\">Medieval Buildings</a> 以及 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/additional-structures\" rel=\"nofollow\">Additional Structures</a> 等模組。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">🏅 許多原版體驗優化也等著您體驗，<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-archeology\" rel=\"nofollow\">Better Archeology</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-advancements\" rel=\"nofollow\">Better Advancements</a> 和 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-burning\" rel=\"nofollow\">Better Burning</a> 只是其中一部分。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">✔️ 「基礎模組」指的是那些不增加太多內容，卻對遊戲體驗至關重要的模組。例如 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/inventory-hud-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\">Inventory HUD+</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/falling-tree\" rel=\"nofollow\">FallingTree</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jade\" rel=\"nofollow\">Jade</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/polymorph\" rel=\"nofollow\">Polymorph</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/not-enough-animations\" rel=\"nofollow\">Not Enough Animations</a>，以及更多。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">👓 當然，憑藉 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/oculus\" rel=\"nofollow\">Oculus</a> 與 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/xenon\" rel=\"nofollow\">Xenon</a> 模組，您可以隨意安裝任何您想要的材質光影。<span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">本整合包推薦（且已預裝）的光影為 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/shaders/complementary-unbound\" rel=\"nofollow\">Complementary Shaders - Unbound</a>。</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">💑 有朋友一起玩嗎？那這絕對是您的理想整合包！我們為多人遊戲加入了許多實用模組，例如 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/simple-voice-chat\" rel=\"nofollow\">Simple Voice Chat</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/security-craft\" rel=\"nofollow\">Security Craft</a> 或 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ydms-weapon-master\" rel=\"nofollow\">YDM's Weapon Master</a>。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong>需要伺服器才能和朋友一起玩嗎？</strong></span></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252flupin\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Essentials/BH_ES_PROMO.webp\" width=\"1920\" height=\"425\"></strong></a></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">如果您在尋找能和朋友遊玩各種整合包的伺服器，<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252flupin\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bisect Hosting</a></strong></span> 就是您的最佳解答！他們提供最具性價比的 Minecraft 伺服器，點擊 <strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252flupin\" rel=\"nofollow\">此連結</a></span></strong> 並使用優惠碼「Lupin」即可享有 25% 折扣。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Essentials/BH_ES_BANNER2.webp\" width=\"1920\" height=\"291\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong>Minecraft 一直載入中？進入世界後畫面帧率（FPS）很低？</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\">請務必確認是否需要 <strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmundominecraft.net%252fen%252fallocate-more-ram%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">增加記憶體（RAM）</a></strong>，大多數問題皆由此引起。若您使用 CurseForge 應用程式，只需點擊設定檔選項，取消勾選「使用系統預設記憶體」並將滑桿向右拖曳即可（我們至少建議設定為 5GB 或 5120 MB）。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\">如果發現仍不夠用，請繼續增加記憶體！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong>伺服器出現錯誤嗎？</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\">很遺憾地，如果您自行架設伺服器，或使用非我推薦的虛擬主機，此整合包可能無法正常運作。 </span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">此整合包與 <strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252flupin\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bisect Hosting</a></strong> 完美相容，因此我強烈建議選擇該主機服務。此外，若透過 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252flupin\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>此連結</strong></a> 註冊並使用優惠碼「Lupin」，同樣可享 25% 折扣。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">請注意，本整合包建議最低配置為 7GB 記憶體。若玩家人數較多，建議進一步增加記憶體容量。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong>我們所有的主題整合包：</strong></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/essentials-modpack\" rel=\"nofollow\">Essentials Mods [Forge/Fabric]</a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/animals-modpack-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\">More Animals [Forge / Fabric]</a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/biomes-modpack-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\">More Biomes [Forge / Fabric]</a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/decorations-modpack-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\">More Decorations [Forge / Fabric]</a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/more-fps-modpack\" rel=\"nofollow\">More FPS [Forge / Fabric]</a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/realistic-modpack-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\">More Realistic [Forge / Fabric]</a></span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Essentials/BH_ES_BANNER3.webp\" width=\"1920\" height=\"291\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/800/677/essentials-mods-3.jpg\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1369\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/800/678/essentials-mods-4.jpg\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1369\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/800/680/essentials-mods-6.jpg\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1369\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/800/675/essentials-mods-2.jpg\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1369\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/X8VY5WMbe4\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/MultiRecipe/BH_Lupin_Discord.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1400\" height=\"285\"></a></span></strong></span></p>",
